#. Default: "<p>This will concatenate selected annex types PDF annexes of selected items into one single PDF file with a limit of <strong>${max_size}</strong>. If your PDF file is too large you will have a message, in this case select less elements and download it separately.<p>"
msgid "concatenate_annexes_batch_action_descr"
msgstr "<p class='discreet'>This action allows you to group documents into a single downloadable PDF. The maximum file size for export is <strong>${max_size}</strong>. If you see a message stating that the file is too large, please select fewer items to export. Once you click «Download», please wait until the PDF file is ready.<p>"

